Package: optimizers7
Title: An S7 Framework for Optimisation Algorithms
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Tinervia", , "giovannitinervia9@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements optimisation algorithms using the S7 object-oriented
    system, with the numerical work in C++. An optimiser is an object carrying
    its own settings, safeguards and stopping rule; the stopping rule is itself
    a composable object, and the objective may be an R function, a finite sum
    over observations, or a compiled C++ function reached through an external
    pointer.
